{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And he took six hundred chosen chariots.</b> The choicest among his chariots, of all the chariots that he had." "And third men (ושלישים). Know that the king is like one in reckoning; therefore the one second to him in rank is called mishneh, from the root of shenayim (two), and the one third in rank is called shlishi."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:20.556762332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}